Consent-first AI fashion visualization guide\"><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Ask Permission Before Sharing an Outfit Mock-Up | ClothOff AI\"><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Confirm the exact image, edit and audience in a short request before publishing a preview.\"><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://clothoffai.fun/assets/clothoff-user-fashion-editorial.jpg\"><meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-11-26T00:00:00.000Z\"><meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Ask Permission Before Sharing an Outfit Mock-Up\",\"description\":\"Confirm the exact image, edit and audience in a short request before publishing a preview.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://clothoffai.fun/blog/ask-permission-before-sharing-outfit-mockup/\",\"image\":\"https://clothoffai.fun/assets/clothoff-adult-swimwear-editorial.jpg\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"ClothOff AI independent editorial team\",\"url\":\"https://clothoffai.fun/about/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"ClothOff AI\",\"url\":\"https://clothoffai.fun\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://clothoffai.fun/favicon.svg\"}},\"about\":[\"Ask Permission Before Sharing an Outfit Mock-Up\",\"How do I get clear permission for sharing a clothing mock-up with another adult in it\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://clothoffai.fun\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://clothoffai.fun/blog/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Ask Permission Before Sharing an Outfit Mock-Up\",\"item\":\"https://clothoffai.fun/blog/ask-permission-before-sharing-outfit-mockup/\"}]}]}</script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_astro/BaseLayout.Dhweq6P0.css\"><style data-english-layout-repair>@media(min-width:641px) and (max-width:980px){.signal-strip{flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-start;gap:14px 20px}}</style><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://clothoffai.fun/blog/ask-permission-before-sharing-outfit-mockup/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://clothoffai.fun/blog/ask-permission-before-sharing-outfit-mockup/\"></head><body><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">Skip to content</a><header class=\"site-header\" data-header><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"ClothOff AI home\"><span class=\"brand-mark\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2 20 5v6c0 5.2-3.4 9.4-8 11-4.6-1.6-8-5.8-8-11V5l8-3Z\"></path><path d=\"m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.9-5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"brand-copy\"><strong>CLOTHOFF<span>AI</span></strong></span></a><nav class=\"desktop-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/#about\">What it is</a><a href=\"/#safe-use\">Safe use</a><a href=\"/#compare\">Comparison</a><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></nav><a class=\"header-cta\" href=\"https://spicy-box.com/?utm_ref=6cc1a8f534d264bd\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Take a Look <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></a><details class=\"language-menu\"><summary aria-label=\"Language\">EN</summary><div><a href=\"/blog/ask-permission-before-sharing-outfit-mockup/\" lang=\"en\" aria-current=\"page\">English</a></div></details><button class=\"menu-button\" type=\"button\" data-menu-button aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"mobile-nav\" data-mobile-nav><a href=\"/#about\">What it is</a><a href=\"/#safe-use\">Safe use</a><a href=\"/#compare\">Comparison</a><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></div></header><main id=\"main-content\"><article class=\"article-shell\"><header class=\"article-header\"><nav class=\"breadcrumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a><span>/</span><span aria-current=\"page\">Practical Guides</span></nav><a class=\"back-link\" href=\"/blog/\">← All ClothOff AI comparisons</a><div class=\"post-meta\"><span>Practical Guides</span><span>1 min read</span></div><h1>Ask Permission Before Sharing an Outfit Mock-Up</h1><p>Confirm the exact image, edit and audience in a short request before publishing a preview.</p><div class=\"article-author\"><span class=\"brand-mark\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2 20 5v6c0 5.2-3.4 9.4-8 11-4.6-1.6-8-5.8-8-11V5l8-3Z\"></path><path d=\"m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.9-5\"></path></svg></span><div><strong>ClothOff AI independent editorial team</strong><small>Independent, consent-first editorial comparison</small></div></div></header><div class=\"article-layout\"><aside><div class=\"toc\"><span>ON THIS PAGE</span><a href=\"#article-content\">Comparison</a><a href=\"#sources\">Sources</a><a href=\"#related\">Related comparisons</a></div></aside><div><div class=\"article-content\" id=\"article-content\"><p>Use your own image or get agreement from the adult shown before making and sharing an outfit mock-up. The eSafety Commissioner explains consent for sharing images. Make the request specific enough that everyone can recognize the same edit and the audience it will reach.</p>\n<h2 id=\"ask-about-one-image-and-its-use\">Ask about one image and its use</h2>\n<p>Suppose a friend offers a photo of themselves wearing a winter coat. Ask whether you may make a mock-up of the same full coat in another color, then show only the agreed preview privately. Ask separately before using it in a public gallery. Show them the final preview and describe the planned audience.</p>\n<img src=\"/assets/editorial-ask-permission-before-sharing-outfit-mockup.png\" alt=\"Identify the original photo. Describe the visible change. Confirm the audience in writing.\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<h2 id=\"keep-the-approved-version-identifiable\">Keep the approved version identifiable</h2>\n<p>Save the file name, agreed destination and date in your own records. If you change the crop, purpose or audience, check with the person again. Add a visible label that says the outfit color was edited, so a viewer knows what the preview shows.</p>\n</div><div class=\"key-rule\"><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2 20 5v6c0 5.2-3.4 9.4-8 11-4.6-1.6-8-5.8-8-11V5l8-3Z\"></path><path d=\"m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.9-5\"></path></svg></div><div><strong>The rule that covers every tool</strong><p>Do not create, request, or share an intimate or misleading edit of a real person without their explicit, informed consent. When in doubt, use a mannequin or a fully synthetic fashion subject.</p></div></div><section class=\"source-list\" id=\"sources\"><h2>Sources and further reading</h2><p>These primary references inform the privacy, provenance, and risk-management principles used in this comparison.</p><ul><li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">eSafety Commissioner on photo and video consent</a></li><li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Adobe Content Credentials overview</a></li></ul></section></div></div></article><section class=\"related section\" id=\"related\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><div class=\"section-kicker\">Continue reading</div><h2>Related ClothOff AI comparisons</h2></div></div><div class=\"post-grid compact\"><article class=\"post-card violet\"><a href=\"/blog/clothoff-ai-vs-adobe-firefly/\" aria-label=\"Read ClothOff AI vs Adobe Firefly: Consent, Edit Control and Provenance\"><div class=\"post-body\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span>Comparison</span><span>7 min read</span></div><h3>ClothOff AI vs Adobe Firefly: Consent, Edit Control and Provenance</h3><p>Compare a high-risk ClothOff AI search intent with Adobe Firefly&#39;s selection-based editing, usage rules, Content Credentials and credit questions.</p><strong>Read comparison <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></strong></div></a></article><article class=\"post-card pink\"><a href=\"/blog/clothoff-ai-vs-ai-outfit-changer/\" aria-label=\"Read ClothOff AI vs AI Outfit Changers: Choose a Visible Garment\"><div class=\"post-body\"><div class=\"post-meta\"><span>Comparison</span><span>7 min read</span></div><h3>ClothOff AI vs AI Outfit Changers: Choose a Visible Garment</h3><p>A practical comparison of synthetic-undressing search intent with consent-first outfit replacement, including edit controls, rights and repeatable quality checks.</p><strong>Read comparison <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"></path></svg></strong></div></a></article></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-top\"><div><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"brand-mark\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2 20 5v6c0 5.2-3.4 9.4-8 11-4.6-1.6-8-5.8-8-11V5l8-3Z\"></path><path d=\"m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.9-5\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"brand-copy\"><strong>CLOTHOFF<span>AI</span></strong></span></a><p>An independent ClothOff AI safety and education resource for consent-first photo editing, virtual try-on, and responsible AI fashion visualization.</p></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href=\"/#about\">What is ClothOff AI?</a><a href=\"/#safe-use\">Safety checklist</a><a href=\"/#alternatives\">Safe alternatives</a><a href=\"/about/\">About ClothOff AI</a></div><div><h3>ClothOff AI blog</h3><a href=\"/blog/ask-permission-before-sharing-outfit-mockup/\">Ask Permission Before Sharing an Outfit Mock-Up</a><a href=\"/blog/report-altered-image-by-post-link/\">What to Record When Someone Sends an Altered Image Link</a><a href=\"/blog/stopncii-synthetic-image-eligibility-clothoff-search/\">Can StopNCII Help With a Synthetic Image of You?</a></div><div class=\"footer-legal\"><h3>Information</h3><a href=\"/contact/\">contact</a><a href=\"/editorial-policy/\">Editorial policy</a><a href=\"/privacy/\">privacy</a><a href=\"/terms/\">terms</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© <span data-year>2026</span> ClothOff AI</span><span>Adults only • Consent first • No image uploads</span><span>Independent educational resource</span></div></footer><script src=\"/assets/main.js\"></script><div id=\"site-analytics\" data-measurement-id=\"G-9QVGWT46P8\" data-domain=\"clothoffai.fun\" data-analytics-mode=\"automatic\" hidden></div><script defer src=\"/analytics-consent.js?v=20261007-auto\"></script></body></html>"
